[{"id":"linux-a12-advanced-gate","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Linux","tags":["进阶","安全边界"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(十二)进阶路线.md","articleTitle":"Linux(十二)进阶路线","articlePath":"posts/9efa11cb/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(十二)进阶路线.md","articleTitle":"Linux(十二)进阶路线","articlePath":"posts/9efa11cb/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>什么条件下才适合执行 Linux 进阶命令？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>有明确问题、官方手册、隔离环境、变更前快照、回滚方案和复测证据。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>执行前把入口、对象和恢复路径写成一张检查表：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight text\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">问题已收敛 -&gt; 官方手册已读 -&gt; 隔离对象已准备\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">          -&gt; 变更前快照已保存 -&gt; 回滚命令已演练\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">          -&gt; 成功证据与停止条件已定义\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>缺任何一项都只做只读观察。需要真实块设备、内核权限、凭据或停机窗口的能力，不能因为命令在练习机上存在就直接执行。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"a08-compatibility-is-not-equality","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"AI 大模型应用","tags":["AI 大模型应用","测试开发"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/llm-application/AI 大模型应用(八)多厂商接口适配.md","articleTitle":"AI 大模型应用(八)多厂商接口适配","articlePath":"posts/28205af6/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/llm-application/AI 大模型应用(八)多厂商接口适配.md","articleTitle":"AI 大模型应用(八)多厂商接口适配","articlePath":"posts/28205af6/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":1,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>“迁移验证”的课程边界中，为什么“兼容性”不是“相等”？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>兼容性只说明接口能协同工作；输出、边界错误和语义相等仍需逐项验证。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>多厂商适配要保持业务语义而非字段表面相同；能力矩阵、错误映射和不支持项必须显式记录。把这条区别落到夹具：分别构造正常、越界和撤销样本，保存用三个 Fake provider 返回相同任务的不同事件形状，适配层将能力缺失归为 unsupported 而不是空结果。兼容层不能创造底层没有的能力；迁移前需保留回滚和原始响应。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"pytest-public-private-api","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Pytest","tags":["API 边界"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(十二)进阶路线.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(十二)进阶路线","articlePath":"posts/76bdbbc7/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(十二)进阶路线.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(十二)进阶路线","articlePath":"posts/76bdbbc7/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>扩展 Pytest 时如何识别公开 API 与私有实现？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>以稳定 API Reference、公开 Hook 规范和当前弃用说明为准；带下划线的内部模块、缓存和未承诺字段默认不作为合同。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>公开 API 的判断来自稳定 API Reference、Hook 规范和弃用说明，不是来自“当前能 import”。私有字段常以 \u003ccode>_\u003c/code> 开头，可能在小版本中改变，甚至没有兼容承诺：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>依赖方式\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>处理策略\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>公开 Hook / 配置\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>直接使用，记录适用版本\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>已弃用但仍可用\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>标出替代项和迁移窗口\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>私有模块或字段\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>集中在适配层，单独做升级复验\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>业务测试不应直接依赖私有实现；如果插件暂时无法绕开它，至少把风险封装在一个小适配层，并为升级保留失败证据。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"pytest-parallel-isolation","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Pytest","tags":["并行隔离"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(十三)项目实战.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(十三)项目实战","articlePath":"posts/b428e868/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(十三)项目实战.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(十三)项目实战","articlePath":"posts/b428e868/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>如何证明套件在并行执行下真正隔离？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>让 worker 使用独立命名空间，运行串行和多 worker 两次，比较结果、资源清理和报告中的 Node ID/worker 证据。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>并行隔离要让资源命名包含 worker 边界，并用对照实验证明它确实生效：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">resource_name\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"params\">worker_id: \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">str\u003c/span>\u003c/span>) -&gt; \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">str\u003c/span>:\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">return\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">f&quot;orders-\u003cspan class=\"subst\">&#123;worker_id&#125;\u003c/span>&quot;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>先串行运行，再以两个 worker 运行同一套件，比较结果、清理状态和报告中的 Node ID/worker；随后故意让两个 worker 竞争固定文件、端口或数据库键，确认它会失败，再用 \u003ccode>worker_id\u003c/code>、锁或临时目录修复并重复测量。只有这样才能区分“真的隔离”和“恰好没有碰撞”。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"testing-basics-a05-concept-1","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"测试基础","tags":["风险","优先级"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(五)测试计划与风险管理.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(五)测试计划与风险管理","articlePath":"posts/cb5d3b8f/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(五)测试计划与风险管理.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(五)测试计划与风险管理","articlePath":"posts/cb5d3b8f/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>时间不够时应该先测什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>按风险和需求重要性优先取得关键证据，同时满足依赖与资源条件，并明确未测范围。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>测试时间有限时，先选择可能造成较大损失、又有理由怀疑会出错的规则。优先级不是固定的页面顺序，也不是“容易测的先测”。\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>借阅情形\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>安排及理由\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>刚改资格逻辑\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>先做冻结与启用会员对照，核对拒绝后库存和记录不变\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>重复归还可能多加库存\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>先建立一条可归还记录，再检查重复操作；准备动作不能省略\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>身份服务不可用\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>升级阻塞或安排不依赖它的任务；替身结果不等于真实集成结果\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>非关键标点未检查\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>记录未测范围，由负责人接受或另排，不宣称已覆盖\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>依赖使某条低风险准备操作先执行，并不意味着高风险用例被降级。每次安排变化都应保留理由和剩余风险。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]